      "text": "Magnetic structure of A ≤ 10 nuclei using the Norfolk nuclear models with quantum Monte Carlo methods — 26 sections: Magnetic structure of A 10 nuclei ; Introduction; Theory\n\n**Magnetic structure of A ≤ 10 nuclei using the Norfolk nuclear models with quantum Monte Carlo methods**\n\n*Pastore1,4,§ M. Piarulli1,4,¶ R. Schiavilla2,3,∗∗and R. B. Wiringa5††*\n\n29 pp, 26 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Magnetic structure of A 10 nuclei using the No; Introduction; Theory; Quantum Monte Carlo methods; The Norfolk interaction model; The electromagnetic current operator; Magnetic form factors and moments; Results and Discussion; Magnetic moments; VMC magnetic moments of A=3-7 nuclei; VMC magnetic moments of A=8-10 nuclei; GFMC magnetic moments of A=3-9 nuclei; Scaled two-body magnetic densities; Model dependencies in two-body magnetic densit; Magnetic form factors and high-momentum struct; Tritium and Helium-3; Lithium-6; Lithium-7 and Beryllium-7",
